# Shell scripts must stay LF even on Windows checkouts (core.autocrlf), or the
# CRLF shebang breaks them under Git Bash ("env: 'sh\r': No such file").
*.sh text eol=lf
# Golden traces are compared byte-for-byte with output a host program just
# produced (LF). A CRLF checkout would make every single line differ.
*.trace text eol=lf
